      965     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-create-complete     AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO.
      966     DEFINE VARIABLE adm-create-on-add       AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO INIT ?.
      967     DEFINE VARIABLE group-assign-target     AS LOGICAL   NO-UNDO INIT ?.
